3. The Decoupling Rationale in Dual-TCR 
Dual-TCR is designed to resolve the fundamental trade-off: 
SAM 1 provides precise geometric decoding but lacks semantic discriminability, whereas RADIO provides spatially coherent, artifact-free semantic localization. Our framework decouples these two capabilities, functioning as a plug-and-play, training-free system that can adapt to future geometric backbones without costly retraining 

